Viktor 10.10.2026: «The Artist cannot draw: steps: 4 to 16 for this painter with Lightning» with 16 on the screen; «нужно отключать Lightning Guidance, если Lightning LoRA не подключен»; «я в своём случае хочу отключать Lightning режим, потому как это для прототипов, а не для финальных выхлопов»; the plan he took: fp8 fine-tunes without Lightning by default (30 steps, guidance 4), GGUF Q4/Q6 with it, an explicit switch with its strength beside it, guidance only without it, no switch without its file.

The page clamped the steps for the screen but kept and sent the number typed; now it keeps and sends them clamped. Lightning is a switch (lightOn) beside its strength (kept while it is off; a strength kept before this reads as on); the time, the stage's line and To the form ask the switch; the boxes hide as they show (.field's display beat [hidden]).

Suite: 593/0 in the kitchen (1319's check rewritten for the new defaults, 1318's time five minutes now, 1328's checks look at what shows).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
